  "No posts are planned. Accepted text stays in Library until it is scheduled; runs without a publish intent have no planned date.": "目前沒有已排程的貼文。已接受的文字會保留在資料庫中，直到排程為止；沒有發布意圖的執行沒有計畫日期。", "No matching plans in the returned history — the full schedule is unknown (history is bounded).": "傳回的紀錄中沒有符合的計畫 — 完整排程未知（紀錄數量有上限）。", "Planned posts by day": "依日期列出已排程的貼文", "Unresolved": "未解析", "Unresolved plan": "未解析的計畫", "{count} publish intent id appears more than once and was withheld — the schedule was not guessed.": "{count} 個發布意圖 ID 重複出現，已暫不採用 — 排程不做推測。",
  "{count} publish intent ids appear more than once and were withheld — the schedule was not guessed.": "{count} 個發布意圖 ID 重複出現，已暫不採用 — 排程不做推測。", "Accepted text": "已接受的文字", "Loading stored draft…": "正在載入已儲存的草稿…", "Open draft and review": "開啟草稿並審查", "Actions in this app start with this team.": "此應用程式的動作會以此團隊執行。", "Awaiting independent review": "等待獨立審查",
